  "content": "[Intro]\n[C]\n[C7M]  [Am7]\n[C/G]  [Fsus2]\n[Em/5+]  [Fsus2]\n\n[Verse]\nThe summer days are gone [C]too soon. You shoot\n[C7M]the moon and miss [Am7]completely. And now\n[C/G]you're left to face [F]the gloom, the empty\n[C]room that once smelled [F]sweetly. Of all the\n[G]flowers you plucked if [C]only you knew the\n[C7M]reason why you [Am7]had to each be\n[C/G]lonely. Was it just [F]the season? sea-\n[C]son. [F]\n[G]  [Am]\n[C/G]  [F#/5-]\n[Fsus2]  [C]\n[G]  [C]\n[G]  [Am]\n[C/G]  [F#/5-]\n[Fsus2]  [C]\n[G]  [C]\n[G]\n(Instrumental Outro to End) [C]\n[C7M]  [Am7]\n[C/G]  [F]\n[C]  [F]\n[G]  [C]\n[C7M]  [Am7]\n[C/G]  [F]\n[C]  [F]\n[C]  [G6]  [C]",
